        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Pursuant to Section 6.35 of the General Terms and Conditions of Corpus Christi Pipeline's FERC Gas Tariff, Original Volume No.1.</span>
